Replace boolean values of ``standardize`` in :class:`.TemporalFilter`, :class:`.fMRIPrepConfoundRemover` and :class:`.JuniferConnectivityMeasure` with ``"zscore_sample"`` (default), ``"psc"`` or ``None``, following ``nilearn``; booleans raise an error. ``"zscore_sample"`` uses the sample standard deviation, while ``True`` used the population one, so standardized values change slightly by `Fede Raimondo`_
